  "_note": "Car form — ADD mode (supplementary; the product reaches it by route, plan §9 Q2). The reference boots in edit and is switched with the `.demo` switcher via `[data-mode=\"add\"]`; on the build that eval is a harmless no-op (no such control) because the build page IS add mode. MODEL phase: `build` points at the reference; flip `build` to http://localhost:3210/office/car for COMPARE.",
